	(text "PMW3610 trackball module: the sensor (with its LM18-LSI lens through the board) and a 1.8 V LDO, on the\njoystick module's mount (joystick-mount-pogo). The pogo pins TB_P1..6 sit where the joystick module has\nJT_P1..6, pin k for pin k: VCC (1), SDIO on ADC1's (2), SCLK on ADC0's (3), NCS on the joystick's free pin\n(4), MOTION on JT_B1's (5), GND (6). The keyboard keeps VCC on while the trackball is used."
